WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.660
Langley's <00:00:00.520>machine <00:00:00.880>was <00:00:01.320>called <00:00:01.620>the <00:00:01.840>Aerodrome.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.320
It <00:00:03.360>was <00:00:03.480>launched <00:00:03.900>from <00:00:04.180>a <00:00:04.340>catapult <00:00:04.800>on

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.520
top <00:00:05.560>of <00:00:05.760>a <00:00:05.860>houseboat <00:00:06.400>in <00:00:06.920>the <00:00:07.040>Potomac

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:07.720
River.
